--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Bundled third-party data
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

* assets/data/google-fonts.json — a catalogue of Google Fonts family names,
  weights, subsets and categories, used to build the Google Fonts CSS2 request.
  The fonts themselves are not bundled: they are downloaded on request from
  fonts.googleapis.com / fonts.gstatic.com and stored locally in
  wp-content/uploads/dashwoo/fonts/ under their own licenses (mostly SIL OFL
  1.1). Each family's license is published by Google Fonts.
* Material Symbols / Material Icons glyph files are likewise downloaded on
  request from fonts.googleapis.com / fonts.gstatic.com and stored locally under
  the Apache License 2.0.
